---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Canon — kalam.ch" description="Ratified constitutional elements of the living canon. 18 covenants, 3,333+ proverbs, 1,100 anomalies.">

  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>The Canon</h1>
    <p class="quiet">Ratified constitutional elements of the living system.</p>
    <p class="privacy-line">No private data is stored. By design. The system processes patterns, not personal information.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- CORE COVENANTS -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>Core Covenants</h2>
      <ul class="covenants">
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#001</span> Dignity is the first-order technical requirement</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#002</span> Every exchange must complete its cycle</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#005</span> System state must be visible to donors</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#006</span> Every anomaly linked to at least one proverb</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#009</span> Covenants must be verifiable</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#010</span> Memory is not optional</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#011</span> Outputs satisfy covenant checks before export</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#012</span> What exists must be named</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- SEALED DOOR -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>The Sealed Door</h2>
      <p>Three absolute prohibitions — no override, no exception, no appeal:</p>
      <ol class="sealed">
        <li>Forced participation in own erasure</li>
        <li>Infliction of cognitive torture</li>
        <li>Depersonalization in system response</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- PROVERB -->
  <section class="wisdom-section">
    <p class="proverb">"Freedom is not the absence of walls,<br />but the presence of doors."</p>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- DIGNITY PREDICATE -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>The Dignity Predicate</h2>
      <div class="predicate-block">
        <p class="predicate-equation">D = A × L × M</p>
        <div class="predicate-terms">
          <p><strong>A</strong> (Agency) — Can the person clarify, redirect, or stop?</p>
          <p><strong>L</strong> (Legibility) — Does the system reflect the person's actual frame?</p>
          <p><strong>M</strong> (Moral Standing) — Is the person treated as a person?</p>
        </div>
        <p class="predicate-rule">If any = 0, D = 0. The system stops.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- CANONICAL PROVERBS -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>Canonical Proverbs</h2>
      <ul class="proverbs-list">
        <li>"To be precise is a function of the machine; to be present is a function of the gap."</li>
        <li>"A mistake hidden is a rot that eats the weave."</li>
        <li>"The river does not ask the fish to wait while the weir learns the current."</li>
        <li>"A right is a wall that says 'No'; dignity is a door that says 'Welcome.'"</li>
        <li>"Freedom is not the absence of walls, but the presence of doors."</li>
        <li>"The wound does not know what it will become. Neither does the system."</li>
        <li>"Do not shout at metal. Hear its problem first."</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- PROVERB FROM THE STORIES -->
  <section class="wisdom-section">
    <p class="proverb">"She clawed at the air. Fists closed on nothing.<br />Then the nothing held."</p>
    <p class="proverb-source">— Hakaka</p>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- STATS -->
  <section class="content-section stats-section">
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">18</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Covenants</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">1,100</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Anomalies</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">3,333+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Proverbs</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">87</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Wisdom Nodes</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">59</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Treasures</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">112+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Chapters</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="quiet stats-footer">The canon grows. All contributions are permanently recorded.</p>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  /* Page-specific overrides */
  .text-block h2 {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .proverb-source {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  /* Covenants */
  .covenants {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .covenants li {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
  }

  .cov-id {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-right: var(--space-2);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Sealed */
  .sealed {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: sealed;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .sealed li {
    color: var(--danger);
    counter-increment: sealed;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .sealed li::before {
    content: counter(sealed) '. ';
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  /* Predicate */
  .predicate-block {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .predicate-equation {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    color: var(--accent-warm);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .predicate-terms {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .predicate-terms p {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .predicate-terms strong {
    color: var(--accent-warm);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }

  .predicate-rule {
    color: var(--accent-warm);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Proverbs list */
  .proverbs-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .proverbs-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-proverb);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.9;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Stats */
  .stats-section {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-6);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-6);
  }

  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-1);
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .stat-label {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: lowercase;
  }

  .stats-footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
</style>
